Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.45,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\fs30\c&HE5DBD8&\pos(773.334,175.333)}龍園翔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.45,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\fs35\c&HE5DBD8&\pos(1046.667,258)}帶給龍園同學的口信
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.45,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\fs35\c&HE5DBD8&\pos(646.667,598.667)}綾小路同學說
